WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Select and move the editable arrow; undo and redo.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Present the responsive layout; draw a frame and undo.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Edit gradient placement and direction; group and undo.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Paint with the angled Square brush; undo and redo.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Compare, sample, apply and undo chroma key.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Develop the CC0 camera photograph: light, color, detail and comparison.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Play and pause the editable pulse animation.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Browse portable palette, asset and typography libraries.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Compose a brief in the native Agent panel. No provider response is staged.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:38.000
Select and move the editable arrow; undo and redo.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:40.000
The canonical Omadesign logo. Design, paint, develop and animate.
